WEBVTT

00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:13.640
(MUSIC CLIMAXES)

00:00:13.720 --> 00:00:15.600
Quiet down, class.

00:00:17.120 --> 00:00:19.120
Quiet down, class.

00:00:19.160 --> 00:00:21.440
People. People.

00:00:22.440 --> 00:00:25.480
So, what do you want to be...
when you grow up?

00:00:25.520 --> 00:00:26.800
Ooh, ooh!
Samantha?

00:00:26.840 --> 00:00:29.000
I wanna be a doctor.
Wonderful.

00:00:29.040 --> 00:00:30.240
Ooh!
Bradley?

00:00:30.280 --> 00:00:33.560
I wanna be a teacher!
No, you do not.

00:00:33.600 --> 00:00:34.880
Ooh! M-Me, me!
Yes?

00:00:34.920 --> 00:00:37.040
I wanna be a fireman,
who's also president

00:00:37.120 --> 00:00:38.960
and also drives race cars! Yeah!

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:40.920
Exciting.

00:00:40.960 --> 00:00:42.960
And what about you, Gru?

00:00:44.240 --> 00:00:45.840
Gru?

00:00:45.880 --> 00:00:48.640
Me? I want to be...

00:00:50.080 --> 00:00:52.600
..a super villain.

00:00:53.640 --> 00:00:56.960
(RAUCOUS LAUGHTER)
Super-villain? Loser!

00:00:57.000 --> 00:00:59.000
(SCHOOL BELL RINGS)

00:00:59.040 --> 00:01:01.080
(LIVELY CHATTER)

00:01:02.520 --> 00:01:04.520
Kelly!
Daddy!

00:01:04.560 --> 00:01:06.560
Brett!
Mom!

00:01:06.600 --> 00:01:09.760
Gru!
(SPEAKS MINIONESE) (SMOOCHES)

00:01:09.840 --> 00:01:13.000
Oh! My favourite tiny relatives.
(CHUCKLES)

00:01:14.560 --> 00:01:16.800
Eh, oh, no, guys...
No, guys, come on!

00:01:16.840 --> 00:01:20.000
(KISSING)
Hey, I got an image to uphold here!

00:01:20.040 --> 00:01:22.360
(GIGGLING)
Hey!

00:01:22.440 --> 00:01:23.560
(SPEAKS MINIONESE)

00:01:23.600 --> 00:01:26.800
OK. Hey, are you guys
pumped for the movie?

00:01:26.840 --> 00:01:28.000
Let's go!
(BUTTON BEEPS)

00:01:28.040 --> 00:01:31.160
(GIGGLES) (MINIONS CHATTER)

00:01:32.160 --> 00:01:34.440
(BRIGHT, UPBEAT MUSIC)

00:01:42.040 --> 00:01:44.320
(SCREAMING ON SCREEN)

00:01:44.360 --> 00:01:46.720
(TENSE, DRAMATIC MUSIC)

00:01:46.760 --> 00:01:48.320
(CLICK) (GAS FIZZES)

00:01:49.320 --> 00:01:51.280
(THUDDING)

00:01:51.320 --> 00:01:52.320
(GAS FIZZES)

00:01:52.360 --> 00:01:54.520
(SHRILL, HAUNTING MUSIC)

00:01:54.560 --> 00:01:55.680
(LOUD TRUMPING NOISE)

00:01:56.800 --> 00:02:01.120
Oh no!
(GROANING, SCREAMING AND COUGHING)

00:02:02.240 --> 00:02:03.680
(SPEAKS MINIONESE)

00:02:03.720 --> 00:02:05.720
(SPEAKS MINIONESE)
ON SCREEN: Shark!

00:02:05.760 --> 00:02:07.960
Shark!
(MINIONS LAUGH)

00:02:09.960 --> 00:02:12.240
(PINBALL CLANGS)

00:02:13.720 --> 00:02:17.400
Oh! I am a pinball wizard! Whoa-ho!

00:02:17.440 --> 00:02:20.600
Swish! Swish! Swish! Swish! Swish!

00:02:20.640 --> 00:02:24.120
Swish! Swish! Swish!
Swish! Swish! Swish!

00:02:26.520 --> 00:02:29.080
(SPEAKS MINIONESE) (GIGGLES)

00:02:29.120 --> 00:02:32.640
(REPEATEDLY SPEAK MINIONESE)

00:02:35.000 --> 00:02:37.600
(SPEAKS MINIONESE) (LAUGHTER)

00:02:38.800 --> 00:02:40.400
(DEPRESSING TONE)

00:02:40.440 --> 00:02:42.080
A little more. Come on.

00:02:42.120 --> 00:02:43.400
(GROANS)

00:02:43.440 --> 00:02:45.320
Put some of those sprinkles
on there.

00:02:45.360 --> 00:02:46.920
(SQUIRTS)

00:02:46.960 --> 00:02:50.000
(CLUNKING) (MINIONS CHUCKLE)

00:02:50.040 --> 00:02:54.000
Cheese-Ray! Cheese-Ray! Cheese-Ray!
(CACKLES)

00:02:54.080 --> 00:02:55.600
Don't cheese me, bro.

00:02:56.840 --> 00:02:58.720
(LAUGHS WICKEDLY)

00:03:00.360 --> 00:03:01.720
(SPEAKS MINIONESE)

00:03:03.040 --> 00:03:06.560
Mmm! So creamy! So delicious!

00:03:07.560 --> 00:03:10.800
Worth every calorie. Mmm!

00:03:12.160 --> 00:03:13.280
(BICYCLE BELL DINGS)

00:03:16.840 --> 00:03:18.840
Bills, magazines...

00:03:18.880 --> 00:03:21.080
S&H Green Stamps.

00:03:21.120 --> 00:03:22.600
Huh?

00:03:22.640 --> 00:03:23.960
Ooh-hoo!

00:03:25.200 --> 00:03:26.360
Ooh, ooh, ooh!

00:03:27.880 --> 00:03:31.520
Holy guacamole! Where can we listen?
Where can we listen?

00:03:33.240 --> 00:03:34.680
(MINIONESE CHATTER)

00:03:40.080 --> 00:03:41.560
Hello, Mr Gru.

00:03:41.600 --> 00:03:44.480
We've received your application
to the world's best...

00:03:44.520 --> 00:03:46.520
supervillain team, the Vicious Six.

00:03:46.560 --> 00:03:50.360
A recent opening
has become available and...

00:03:50.400 --> 00:03:51.440
And?

00:03:51.480 --> 00:03:53.240
..your interview
is tomorrow at noon.

00:03:53.320 --> 00:03:55.560
Whoo-hoo! Dyn-o-mite!

00:03:55.640 --> 00:03:58.200
(SPEAK MINIONESE) (LAUGH)

00:03:58.240 --> 00:04:01.200
Please go to 417 Main Street.

00:04:01.240 --> 00:04:04.360
The password is, "You're no good."

00:04:04.440 --> 00:04:06.560
"You're no good." Mm-hmm?

00:04:06.600 --> 00:04:08.480
Now get up on the downstroke,

00:04:08.520 --> 00:04:11.200
'cause this invitation
is gonna explode, baby!

00:04:11.240 --> 00:04:13.960
Explode? Oh, no, no, no, no, no!

00:04:14.040 --> 00:04:15.400
(THUD)

00:04:16.560 --> 00:04:19.920
(COUGHING)

00:04:21.240 --> 00:04:23.920
(GIGGLES)

00:04:25.640 --> 00:04:27.960
Ooh-hoo! Very big news, Mom!

00:04:28.000 --> 00:04:30.920
Bleeeuuurgh.
Mom?

00:04:31.920 --> 00:04:33.440
Bleeeuuurgh.

00:04:34.920 --> 00:04:36.920
Bleeeuuurgh.
Mom?

00:04:38.200 --> 00:04:39.760
Bleeeuuurgh.

00:04:41.840 --> 00:04:43.400
Bleeeuuurgh.

00:04:44.760 --> 00:04:46.360
BOTH: Bleeeuuurgh.

00:04:46.400 --> 00:04:48.160
Wh...at?!

00:04:48.200 --> 00:04:51.880
Mom, who is this sweaty guy?
He's stinking up the house.

00:04:51.920 --> 00:04:53.600
I thought you were cooking cabbage.

00:04:53.640 --> 00:04:55.720
He's my new guru.

00:04:55.760 --> 00:04:57.560
Bleeeuuurgh.
(GIGGLES)

00:04:57.600 --> 00:04:59.320
Bleeeuuurgh.

00:04:59.360 --> 00:05:00.840
Tell your weird buddies

00:05:00.880 --> 00:05:03.440
they'd better start
pulling their weight around here,

00:05:03.480 --> 00:05:04.560
or I'm kicking them out.

00:05:04.600 --> 00:05:07.680
They are killing my mellow vibes!
(GROANS)

00:05:08.680 --> 00:05:10.240
(IMITATES MOCKINGLY)

00:05:10.280 --> 00:05:11.840
Hey! I heard that!

00:05:13.720 --> 00:05:17.200
(FAST-PACED, ACTION MUSIC)

00:05:17.320 --> 00:05:20.040
Come on! Let's go tell the troops
the good news!

00:05:21.760 --> 00:05:26.080
Gentlemen, to the basement,
aka our new evil lair!

00:05:27.880 --> 00:05:29.760
(LAUGHS)

00:05:29.800 --> 00:05:33.280
This is fantastic!
Oh, construction looks great, guys!

00:05:33.320 --> 00:05:35.840
(MINIONESE CHATTER) (CLANGING)

00:05:38.120 --> 00:05:40.880
(GRUNTING)

00:05:40.920 --> 00:05:43.840
(MINIONS SING CECILIA)

